# Wing Row: The Boneyard, track 2 (SPEC 19.5). Tight weaving down the
# parked bomber rows on the old taxiway: three passes, each a pinch point
# under the tails (narrow, in their shadows), two jet blasts across the
# narrows where there is no room to go round, sand drifted over the
# road, then back up the west side past the service bay.
name WING ROW
order 2
floor taxiway
centerline yes
league boneyard
width 44
# x    y    half   features
 200  140   50                     # start line, heading east
 450  130   48     shadow          # under the first bomber's wing
 700  150   46     crates
 860  190   44
 870  310   42
 720  345   38     shadow          # pinch under the tails
 500  330   38
 330  370   42
 330  480   44     drift
 500  520   44     vent:right,period=300,warn=50
 700  500   42
 860  560   42
 870  690   42
 700  730   38     shadow          # second pinch
 480  710   38     vent:left,period=300,warn=50,phase=150
 340  770   42
 290  880   46     crates
 170  875   46
 125  700   46     drift
 130  420   48     bay:left
 150  240   50
props tail,gear seg 1 side left gap 70 off 24
props tail seg 5 side both gap 70 off 24
props engine,gear seg 9 side right gap 90 off 24
props tail seg 13 side both gap 70 off 24
props wingtip,engine seg 18 side left gap 90 off 24
